If they concede points,

12
00:00:47,260 --> 00:00:50,110
things heat up.

13
00:00:50,110 --> 00:00:56,320
Moreover, this goal is the fruit of Nankatsu's attacking players' efforts to break Otomo's defense,

14
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:59,330
even though Tsubasa controls the entire game.

15
00:00:59,700 --> 00:01:02,280
That's why everything is more important.

16
00:01:03,070 --> 00:01:06,210
So, Nankatsu is motivated to win its 3rd championship...

17
00:01:06,210 --> 00:01:10,680
But... I've mastered the Hawk Shot!

18
00:01:10,680 --> 00:01:13,240
I'll show that we can overtake them immediately!

