58
00:02:44,260 --> 00:02:48,520
EPISODE 32:
TO OVERTHROW TSUBASA! HYUGA VS MISUGI

59
00:02:45,770 --> 00:02:48,770
We're about to pass the 20-minute mark of the final match.

60
00:02:50,140 --> 00:02:52,020
The ball is sent to Taki on the wing.

61
00:02:53,930 --> 00:02:55,530
Urabe steals the ball!

62
00:02:56,780 --> 00:02:57,740
Nitta!

63
00:02:57,740 --> 00:02:59,740
Otomo hits a long pass!

64
00:02:59,740 --> 00:03:01,740
Will it reach Nitta?

65
00:03:01,740 --> 00:03:02,490
Okay!

66
00:03:03,710 --> 00:03:07,830
No, Izawa jumps and blocks it!

67
00:03:07,830 --> 00:03:08,700
What?!

68
00:03:10,950 --> 00:03:13,650
After Nitta mastered the Hawk Shot,

69
00:03:13,650 --> 00:03:16,920
everyone focused on reading the trajectory of the passes.

70
00:03:16,920 --> 00:03:21,340
Since the start of the second half, Nankatsu

71
00:03:21,340 --> 00:03:24,550
got used to Otomo's speed and was able to keep up.

72
00:03:25,410 --> 00:03:26,060
Nitta!

73
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:27,720
Your turn, Takasugi!

74
00:03:27,720 --> 00:03:28,700
Yes!

75
00:03:28,700 --> 00:03:30,140
Another intervention!

76
00:03:30,140 --> 00:03:31,300
Damn it!

77
00:03:31,300 --> 00:03:35,110
As long as I get the ball, I'm here to score...

78
00:03:35,110 --> 00:03:37,860
We're about to reach the 23rd minute of the second half.

79
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:40,860
Nishio steals the ball!

80
00:03:45,580 --> 00:03:46,800
Nitta!

81
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:49,440
Otomo sends a long pass forward.

82
00:03:49,440 --> 00:03:50,080
Okay!

83
00:03:52,680 --> 00:03:55,520
But Nitta is offside!

84
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:56,290
What?!

85
00:03:56,290 --> 00:03:58,000
Good job!

86
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:00,180
Nankatsu's defenders notice Otomo

87
00:04:00,180 --> 00:04:03,340
and set a trap!

88
00:04:03,340 --> 00:04:06,850
Damn it! They read our passes completely!

89
00:04:06,850 --> 00:04:09,350
Only 5 minutes left.

90
00:04:10,520 --> 00:04:12,560
This time, Nankatsu goes on the attack.

91
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:17,880
We can't let Nitta use his Hawk Shot!

92
00:04:18,840 --> 00:04:20,990
But Otomo's defense is determined!

93
00:04:21,390 --> 00:04:21,940
Alright!

94
00:04:21,940 --> 00:04:22,560
What?!

95
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:24,980
Ishizaki gets the rebound.

96
00:04:24,980 --> 00:04:27,680
Ishizaki runs and crosses the sideline.

97
00:04:27,680 --> 00:04:28,280
There!

98
00:04:28,280 --> 00:04:30,150
A trick!

99
00:04:30,150 --> 00:04:33,290
But didn't he go a bit too far?

100
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:36,670
No, Tsubasa is approaching!

101
00:04:36,670 --> 00:04:41,460
Ichijo! Even if there's no shooting angle, Tsubasa will shoot!

102
00:04:41,460 --> 00:04:44,590
Tsubasa shoots after catching the ball.

103
00:04:45,200 --> 00:04:47,300
But it's off target.

104
00:04:47,300 --> 00:04:49,060
Alright!

105
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:52,810
Taki makes a header!

106
00:04:53,580 --> 00:04:54,810
3rd goal!

107
00:04:54,810 --> 00:04:58,810
Goalkeeper Ichijo was completely left behind by Tsubasa.

108
00:04:58,810 --> 00:05:03,780
In the final stage, Nankatsu scores again at the end of the game, like putting the peg in the hole.

109
00:05:03,780 --> 00:05:07,280
Damn it! Is this the real face of Nankatsu?

110
00:05:07,280 --> 00:05:10,360
Only added time remains in the game.

111
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:13,160
This is a good victory for Nankatsu.

112
00:05:13,160 --> 00:05:19,100
Not only himself, but his teammates also work to score points.

113
00:05:19,100 --> 00:05:20,960
So, this is Tsubasa Ozora...

114
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:24,380
Still, I won't give up until the end!

115
00:05:26,500 --> 00:05:28,890
Otomo refuses to give up and continues to attack!

116
00:05:28,890 --> 00:05:32,890
Our mission until the end is to deliver the ball to Nitta.

117
00:05:34,020 --> 00:05:35,480
We'll get the ball to Nitta!

118
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:37,020
Urabe...

119
00:05:37,020 --> 00:05:38,900
We'll get the ball to Nitta!

120
00:05:39,400 --> 00:05:40,480
That's what we have to do!

121
00:05:43,760 --> 00:05:47,040
The whistle blew!

122
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:49,100
Nankatsu won!

123
00:05:49,100 --> 00:05:49,910
We won!

124
00:05:51,490 --> 00:05:54,620
Damn it!

125
00:05:59,270 --> 00:06:00,130
Nitta!

126
00:06:04,160 --> 00:06:09,000
Nitta fired a perfect Hawk Shot at the goal, but it was too late.

127
00:06:09,920 --> 00:06:13,640
The winner of the National Middle School Football Tournament

128
00:06:13,640 --> 00:06:17,380
Shizuoka Prefectural Tournament, Nankatsu in third place.

129
00:06:17,380 --> 00:06:18,330
We did it!

130
00:06:18,330 --> 00:06:20,780
We'll go to the National Tournament again!

131
00:06:21,980 --> 00:06:25,270
Otomo Middle School didn't give up on Nankatsu throughout the game,

132
00:06:25,270 --> 00:06:28,240
but their strength ran out before they could really fight.

133
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:33,950
Nankatsu won because they prevented Otomo from sending the ball to Nitta. That shows their strength.

134
00:06:33,950 --> 00:06:34,740
Yes.

135
00:06:35,340 --> 00:06:38,500
Alright! Now we'll play against Nankatsu once again!

136
00:06:41,500 --> 00:06:42,750
Received Messages

137
00:06:41,500 --> 00:06:42,750
From

138
00:06:41,500 --> 00:06:42,750
To

139
00:06:41,500 --> 00:06:42,750
Japan National Football Federation...

140
00:06:41,500 --> 00:06:42,750
Munemasa Katagiri

141
00:06:41,500 --> 00:06:42,750
Business contact

142
00:06:41,500 --> 00:06:42,750
To inform Mr. Mikami that he has landed at Narita Airport,

143
00:06:41,500 --> 00:06:42,750
I am contacting you. Please

144
00:06:41,500 --> 00:06:42,750
come to the meeting at the Federation's office in Yoyogi.

145
00:06:45,280 --> 00:06:47,480
Nankatsu is really strong.

146
00:06:47,480 --> 00:06:50,660
It was worth coming to watch them.

147
00:06:50,660 --> 00:06:51,840
You're right.

148
00:06:53,500 --> 00:06:55,770
I'm sorry, Nitta.

149
00:06:56,780 --> 00:07:00,770
It's our fault for not being able to get the ball to you.

150
00:07:02,350 --> 00:07:05,270
It's not your fault.

151
00:07:05,270 --> 00:07:09,920
I completely lost to Tsubasa Ozora in this match.

152
00:07:15,160 --> 00:07:16,540
I've made my decision.

153
00:07:17,370 --> 00:07:23,040
From now on, my goal is to catch up to you, Tsubasa, and eventually surpass you.

154
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:28,100
Tsubasa, congratulations on your third consecutive victory in the Shizuoka Prefectural Tournament.

155
00:07:28,100 --> 00:07:29,300
Thank you very much.

156
00:07:29,300 --> 00:07:35,320
You've once again advanced to the Nationals. Is there a player you want to play against?

157
00:07:35,320 --> 00:07:37,560
Someone I want to play against?

158
00:07:38,750 --> 00:07:45,310
The player I want to play against the most right now is Taro Misaki!

159
00:07:45,310 --> 00:07:46,060
Misaki?

160
00:07:46,060 --> 00:07:47,150
Taro?

161
00:07:47,150 --> 00:07:48,360
What did he say?

162
00:07:48,360 --> 00:07:54,270
By Misaki, do you mean the Misaki you formed a duo with in elementary school?

163
00:07:54,270 --> 00:07:55,370
Yes, that's right.

164
00:07:56,050 --> 00:08:00,540
Since the National Youth Football Tournament, his name hasn't been heard in the football world.

165
00:08:00,540 --> 00:08:06,890
People say he couldn't return due to an injury he sustained during that tournament.

166
00:08:06,890 --> 00:08:09,630
That's impossible. We're talking about Misaki here!

167
00:08:11,090 --> 00:08:14,420
I'm sure he's still playing football somewhere.

168
00:08:16,190 --> 00:08:17,220
I'm sure of it.

169
00:08:18,750 --> 00:08:23,480
Damn it! He wants to play against Misaki the most?

170
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:30,690
Tsubasa, I remind you once again, I, the magnificent Kojiro Hyuga, am also in the Nationals!

171
00:08:31,120 --> 00:08:32,070
Let's do it!

172
00:08:32,070 --> 00:08:36,940
Tomorrow we'll crush Musashi Middle School and go to the Nationals as Tokyo representatives!

173
00:08:36,940 --> 00:08:37,700
Yes!

174
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:42,670
Shizuoka Prefectural Tournament champion Nankatsu Middle School.

175
00:08:45,600 --> 00:08:46,960
Ishizaki!

176
00:08:47,420 --> 00:08:48,540
We lost.

177
00:08:48,540 --> 00:08:51,210
I made a promise. I await your orders.

178
00:08:51,210 --> 00:08:51,960
What?

179
00:08:52,610 --> 00:08:55,780
No problem, Urabe. Let's forget about it.

180
00:08:55,780 --> 00:08:58,590
I can't. I gave my word as a man.

181
00:08:58,590 --> 00:09:02,000
Then cheer for us at the Nationals.

182
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:02,770
That's enough.

183
00:09:02,770 --> 00:09:05,480
Are you sure you don't want anything else?

184
00:09:05,480 --> 00:09:06,930
Yes.

185
00:09:06,930 --> 00:09:09,730
Alright then! I'll cheer for you a lot!

186
00:09:09,730 --> 00:09:11,850
In return, don't you dare lose.

187
00:09:11,850 --> 00:09:15,080
You are the representatives of Shizuoka Prefecture.

188
00:09:15,080 --> 00:09:16,240
O-Okay...

189
00:09:19,030 --> 00:09:19,600
JAPAN NATIONAL FOOTBALL FEDERATION

190
00:09:19,950 --> 00:09:23,540
Congratulations on completing 2.5 years of training, Mr. Mikami.

191
00:09:23,540 --> 00:09:26,420
Thanks, Katagiri-kun.

192
00:09:26,420 --> 00:09:29,190
Forgive my rudeness, but here are the documents I mentioned.

193
00:09:29,190 --> 00:09:32,510
Oh... I haven't set foot in Japan, you know...

194
00:09:32,510 --> 00:09:38,580
Mr. Mikami, you will be the coach of the national middle school selection team.

195
00:09:38,580 --> 00:09:41,660
We want you to handle this very important task.

196
00:09:40,010 --> 00:09:44,020
CANDIDATE LIST FOR MIDDLE SCHOOL FOOTBALL TOURNAMENT SELECTION

197
00:09:41,720 --> 00:09:44,020
So I won't have time to rest.

198
00:09:44,520 --> 00:09:46,820
How is Wakabayashi-kun?

199
00:09:46,820 --> 00:09:48,770
He's working hard as always.

200
00:09:49,180 --> 00:09:55,150
Surrounded by top-level professional players in Germany, his skills are developing rapidly.

201
00:09:56,140 --> 00:10:00,370
Even if I'm not there, he'll be good enough on his own.

202
00:10:00,370 --> 00:10:03,370
It seems Tsubasa has grown as well.

203
00:10:03,370 --> 00:10:05,270
Yes, of course.

204
00:10:05,270 --> 00:10:09,380
I can say that there is no player in Japan who can match him.

205
00:10:09,380 --> 00:10:14,670
Will Tsubasa become a legend by achieving a third National championship,

206
00:10:14,670 --> 00:10:17,130
or will his rivals leave him behind?

207
00:10:17,820 --> 00:10:23,140
The summer of Tsubasa and his friends is rapidly approaching.

208
00:10:18,300 --> 00:10:22,640
HOKKAIDO FINALS FURANO MIDDLE SCHOOL - SATSUNISHI MIDDLE SCHOOL

209
00:10:25,600 --> 00:10:28,100
Furano's hurricane in Hokkaido.

210
00:10:25,680 --> 00:10:28,770
FURANO MIDDLE SCHOOL CAPTAIN
HIKARU MATSUYAMA

211
00:10:28,100 --> 00:10:28,760
There!

212
00:10:30,650 --> 00:10:34,650
Okay, go! We'll score as many goals as we can!

213
00:10:34,650 --> 00:10:36,370
Yes, captain!

214
00:10:36,370 --> 00:10:39,060
This is how Furano plays with all its members.

215
00:10:39,060 --> 00:10:41,870
Their teamwork is unmatched in Japan.

216
00:10:41,870 --> 00:10:43,870
Go! Shoot!

217
00:10:46,060 --> 00:10:48,700
The match is over! 7-0!

218
00:10:48,700 --> 00:10:50,520
Furano Middle School won!

219
00:10:51,880 --> 00:10:54,710
They want to take Furano's hurricane to the Nationals

220
00:10:54,710 --> 00:10:58,670
and return to Hokkaido this year with the championship pennant.

221
00:10:58,670 --> 00:11:01,470
Wait, Nankatsu...! Tsubasa!

222
00:11:01,850 --> 00:11:05,850
AKITA PREFECTURAL FINAL - HANAWA MIDDLE SCHOOL - SAKURADA MIDDLE SCHOOL

223
00:11:02,340 --> 00:11:07,850
We are at the final of the Akita Prefectural Competition! Hanawa's Tachibana Twins' football is miraculous!

224
00:11:08,500 --> 00:11:09,730
It's them again!

225
00:11:10,650 --> 00:11:16,730
With their constantly changing attacks, these two have scored 90% of Hanawa's goals.

226
00:11:16,730 --> 00:11:18,280
Let's do it, Kazuo!

227
00:11:18,280 --> 00:11:19,360
Yes, Masao!

228
00:11:21,620 --> 00:11:22,360
Goal!

229
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:24,340
The 5th goal of this match.

230
00:11:25,110 --> 00:11:28,950
We will become national champions this year.

231
00:11:29,290 --> 00:11:31,440
We are in the added time of the second half.

232
00:11:29,330 --> 00:11:32,920
OSAKA PREFECTURAL FINAL
NANIWA MIDDLE SCHOOL - AZUMAICHI MIDDLE SCHOOL

233
00:11:31,440 --> 00:11:32,920
Naniwa is fighting!

234
00:11:33,210 --> 00:11:36,700
Even though they've kept the score at 0-0 thanks to Nakanishi's efforts,

235
00:11:33,710 --> 00:11:37,880
NANIWA MIDDLE SCHOOL
TAICHI NAKANISHI

236
00:11:36,700 --> 00:11:38,530
they can't even score a single goal!

237
00:11:38,530 --> 00:11:41,340
Please, just one goal! Just score one goal!

238
00:11:41,940 --> 00:11:45,430
Azumaichi's defender Soda stole the ball!

239
00:11:45,430 --> 00:11:48,140
I will go to the Nationals!

240
00:11:49,770 --> 00:11:54,360
Come on, Nakanishi, enjoy my Razor Shot!

241
00:11:54,360 --> 00:11:57,480
Soda made a long shot with everything he had!

242
00:11:57,480 --> 00:11:59,320
I won't let you score!

243
00:12:00,480 --> 00:12:01,360
What?!

244
00:12:02,840 --> 00:12:04,110
Alright!

245
00:12:04,910 --> 00:12:06,490
Naniwa is defeated!

246
00:12:06,490 --> 00:12:10,800
Azumaichi Middle School won a ticket to the Nationals for the first time.

247
00:12:10,800 --> 00:12:13,040
No way...

248
00:12:13,040 --> 00:12:15,040
— TOKYO —

249
00:12:15,940 --> 00:12:19,890
Can you hear all that applause?

250
00:12:19,890 --> 00:12:26,140
After 2 years of rehabilitation, the Young Lion of the Field, Jun Misugi, has returned to the game!

251
00:12:29,010 --> 00:12:34,020
~Anime Severler~
Instagram: AnimeSeverlerrr

252
00:12:34,020 --> 00:12:38,780
Since the National Youth Football Tournament, the "Glass Ace" Jun Misugi,

253
00:12:38,780 --> 00:12:42,580
while still fighting his heart disease, after a tough rehabilitation

254
00:12:39,400 --> 00:12:44,070
MUSASHI MIDDLE SCHOOL CAPTAIN
JUN MISUGI

255
00:12:42,580 --> 00:12:46,740
process, returns in his 3rd year of middle school!

256
00:12:47,610 --> 00:12:51,750
I've returned to the fields once again.

257
00:12:51,750 --> 00:12:56,840
Since his personal doctor forbade him from intense exercise lasting more than 30 minutes,

258
00:12:56,840 --> 00:12:58,500
he won't be able to play full-time.

259
00:12:58,500 --> 00:13:06,270
With Musashi added to the roster, they found a shortcut to the finals of this tough tournament.

260
00:13:06,270 --> 00:13:10,310
Even after a two-year break, he plays this well. What a magnificent kid.

261
00:13:11,100 --> 00:13:13,510
— 1 MONTH AGO —

262
00:13:11,620 --> 00:13:13,310
Okay, no problem.

263
00:13:13,770 --> 00:13:15,980
Is this true?

264
00:13:15,980 --> 00:13:20,600
So you're telling me I can play football again, right?

265
00:13:20,600 --> 00:13:24,510
I simply cannot deny your strong will and efforts regarding football.

266
00:13:24,510 --> 00:13:26,570
I will give permission for the tournament.

267
00:13:27,350 --> 00:13:28,310
That's it!

268
00:13:28,310 --> 00:13:29,320
I finally did it!

269
00:13:29,320 --> 00:13:31,910
Congratulations, Captain.

270
00:13:31,910 --> 00:13:33,660
Manager!

271
00:13:33,660 --> 00:13:38,480
Thank you for taking such good care of me over the last 2 years.

272
00:13:38,480 --> 00:13:41,170
Thanks to you, I can play again.

273
00:13:43,920 --> 00:13:44,970
Excuse me.

274
00:13:44,970 --> 00:13:46,670
It's okay.

275
00:13:47,950 --> 00:13:49,930
It's pleasant to be young.

276
00:13:50,640 --> 00:13:52,970
Do your best, Captain.

277
00:13:54,140 --> 00:13:56,730
TOHO ACADEMY - WAITING ROOM

278
00:13:55,120 --> 00:13:56,730
As understood from the data,

279
00:13:56,730 --> 00:13:59,310
Musashi defends in the first half before changing,

280
00:13:59,310 --> 00:14:02,230
and bets on the second half when Misugi enters the game.

281
00:14:02,230 --> 00:14:04,940
Listen, the first half is the key to this match.

282
00:14:04,030 --> 00:14:07,240
TOHO ACADEMY COACH
MAKOTO KITAZUME

283
00:14:04,940 --> 00:14:09,180
We'll score freely in the first half while Misugi is out, and finish it before he comes in.

284
00:14:09,180 --> 00:14:10,240
Yes!

285
00:14:10,980 --> 00:14:13,740
We need to watch this final match properly.

286
00:14:13,740 --> 00:14:16,620
Nankatsu is not our only rival.

287
00:14:16,620 --> 00:14:17,450
Okay.

288
00:14:17,450 --> 00:14:20,460
Both teams are emerging.

289
00:14:23,820 --> 00:14:30,130
Toho Academy, aiming to be in the top 3 at the Nationals, starts playing their ace Hyuga, even though they let him rest until now.

290
00:14:30,130 --> 00:14:32,550
Hyuga is playing from the start despite being rested.

291
00:14:32,550 --> 00:14:38,810
Musashi doesn't send Misugi out yet, opening the match with a defensive formation.

292
00:14:39,420 --> 00:14:40,770
Hey, Sanae.

293
00:14:40,770 --> 00:14:43,570
He's going to record it now, right?

294
00:14:47,660 --> 00:14:49,030
Okay, that's enough!

295
00:14:49,030 --> 00:14:51,320
Is it over?

296
00:14:51,320 --> 00:14:53,260
Because we played yesterday.

297
00:14:53,260 --> 00:14:56,210
You should let your body rest and cool down for today.

298
00:14:56,210 --> 00:14:57,090
Okay!

299
00:14:57,090 --> 00:15:00,670
Alright, now I can take a look at the Tokyo Tournament.

300
00:15:04,090 --> 00:15:07,420
There's someone here who doesn't know the meaning of resting.

301
00:15:07,420 --> 00:15:11,190
Tsubasa! The Tokyo Tournament finals are about to begin.

302
00:15:11,190 --> 00:15:12,850
Give me a few more minutes.

303
00:15:17,400 --> 00:15:18,350
This is not good.

304
00:15:19,330 --> 00:15:22,440
"Take your long shots with the Drive Shot."

305
00:15:22,440 --> 00:15:26,690
"Unless you master this shot, you won't become a first-class player," right?

306
00:15:27,610 --> 00:15:33,570
Usually, you hit the ball with your body weight, so it doesn't fly very high.

307
00:15:33,570 --> 00:15:36,740
For that, the next level is the Drive Shot.

308
00:15:37,440 --> 00:15:43,750
This shot flies high, passes the goalkeeper, then makes a sharp dive and scores.

309
00:15:44,320 --> 00:15:46,750
Roberto, it's hard to master.

310
00:15:47,780 --> 00:15:50,660
Shooting with spin added from the sides is easy,

311
00:15:50,660 --> 00:15:54,800
but how can I add a backspin to a ball?

312
00:15:55,810 --> 00:16:00,300
If you were here to show me the basics, I could figure it out quickly.

313
00:16:00,300 --> 00:16:02,640
I guess I have to practice on my own.

314
00:16:03,990 --> 00:16:06,420
Roberto, just one more year.

315
00:16:06,420 --> 00:16:08,300
Then I'll go to Brazil.

316
00:16:09,870 --> 00:16:15,050
Damn it, we can't let him train alone!

317
00:16:15,050 --> 00:16:17,030
Okay guys, we'll train too!

318
00:16:17,030 --> 00:16:17,800
Alright!

319
00:16:17,800 --> 00:16:18,760
Tsubasa!

320
00:16:18,760 --> 00:16:20,660
We'll join you.

321
00:16:20,660 --> 00:16:25,510
Sanae-chan, how is it going with Tsubasa-kun?

322
00:16:25,510 --> 00:16:27,380
Is everything okay?

323
00:16:27,380 --> 00:16:30,880
Our relationship is as you see it.

324
00:16:35,860 --> 00:16:38,930
Yayoi-chan, it's impossible for us.

325
00:16:38,930 --> 00:16:42,940
Tsubasa only has eyes for football.

326
00:16:45,880 --> 00:16:47,980
Toho and Musashi...

327
00:16:47,980 --> 00:16:49,980
A clash between Hyuga and Misugi, huh?

328
00:16:49,980 --> 00:16:54,240
Whichever side wins, I'll be the ultimate winner!

329
00:16:54,240 --> 00:16:55,580
Go!

330
00:16:55,580 --> 00:16:59,490
Sawada cut through Musashi's intense defense.

331
00:16:59,490 --> 00:17:01,040
Going well, Takeshi.

332
00:17:06,730 --> 00:17:08,210
Third goal!

333
00:17:08,210 --> 00:17:08,640
Hah!

334
00:17:08,640 --> 00:17:11,130
He already scored a hat-trick in the first half!

335
00:17:11,130 --> 00:17:14,880
Kojiro Hyuga, the attacker who actually reigns all over the country.

336
00:17:15,360 --> 00:17:18,140
Toho's team is incredibly strong as well.

337
00:17:18,140 --> 00:17:21,110
On the other hand, Musashi concedes so much in the defensive first half

338
00:17:21,110 --> 00:17:22,930
and takes an extremely painful blow.

339
00:17:23,720 --> 00:17:25,710
Coach, I'll play.

340
00:17:25,710 --> 00:17:27,940
But Misugi, you should play in the second half.

341
00:17:28,350 --> 00:17:31,680
If there are more goals, we won't be able to win this.

342
00:17:31,680 --> 00:17:33,520
I'll leave when 30 minutes pass.

343
00:17:33,520 --> 00:17:34,950
Let me play, Coach.

344
00:17:36,110 --> 00:17:39,030
Musashi decides to make a change here.

345
00:17:42,230 --> 00:17:43,750
20 minutes left of the first half.

346
00:17:43,750 --> 00:17:46,330
Misugi enters the game!

347
00:17:46,330 --> 00:17:49,710
A tough strategy with the idea of preventing more goals.

348
00:17:49,710 --> 00:17:51,700
It's useless, Misugi.

349
00:17:51,700 --> 00:17:56,220
Even if you come out now, there's no way Toho Academy will lose.

350
00:17:56,970 --> 00:17:59,500
Sorry we let them score three times.

351
00:17:59,500 --> 00:18:00,600
What are you saying?

352
00:18:00,600 --> 00:18:02,460
Only three goals.

353
00:18:02,460 --> 00:18:05,100
10 minutes left in this half, plus 30 more in the second.

354
00:18:05,100 --> 00:18:08,230
If we score every 10 minutes, we can win.

355
00:18:08,230 --> 00:18:10,150
Look, it's starting now!

356
00:18:10,150 --> 00:18:13,740
Let them taste what Musashi's football really looks like!

357
00:18:13,740 --> 00:18:14,740
Yes!

358
00:18:14,740 --> 00:18:18,840
As soon as Misugi arrives, Musashi goes on the attack.

359
00:18:18,840 --> 00:18:20,160
The match continues!

360
00:18:23,200 --> 00:18:27,930
Musashi entrusts the ball to their control tower, relying on him as a playmaker.

361
00:18:28,760 --> 00:18:32,670
Will Toho's overwhelming power in this match be reversed?

362
00:18:32,670 --> 00:18:34,090
Come on, Misugi.

363
00:18:34,090 --> 00:18:35,800
Take this as a greeting!

364
00:18:37,860 --> 00:18:38,550
What?!

365
00:18:38,550 --> 00:18:40,210
Go, Takeshi!

366
00:18:41,380 --> 00:18:42,180
Sawada!

367
00:18:43,430 --> 00:18:44,430
I caught you!

368
00:18:45,680 --> 00:18:46,430
What?!

369
00:18:47,500 --> 00:18:50,940
Despite not being on guard, Misugi makes an elegant jump!

370
00:18:51,940 --> 00:18:53,940
Let's go! We'll score our first goal now!

371
00:18:53,940 --> 00:18:54,690
Okay!

372
00:18:54,690 --> 00:18:58,180
Musashi's leading trio advances towards the target.

373
00:18:58,180 --> 00:19:00,700
What kind of pass will he make and to whom?

374
00:19:00,700 --> 00:19:02,990
Switch to man-to-man defense!

375
00:19:02,990 --> 00:19:05,650
Toho's defenders mark the trio.

376
00:19:05,650 --> 00:19:12,250
The one protecting the goal is the 1st middle school goalkeeper who hasn't conceded a single goal in this tournament, Wakashimazu!

377
00:19:12,250 --> 00:19:13,910
Here I come, Toho.

378
00:19:13,910 --> 00:19:17,980
I sacrificed two years and bet everything on this 3rd year.

379
00:19:17,980 --> 00:19:21,010
Do you think I'll lose here before going to the Nationals?

380
00:19:21,010 --> 00:19:24,010
Before meeting Tsubasa?

381
00:19:25,260 --> 00:19:26,140
What?!

382
00:19:26,140 --> 00:19:27,980
This is unexpected!

383
00:19:27,980 --> 00:19:32,400
He left the defense behind and cleared the path to the goal while keeping the ball!

384
00:19:32,400 --> 00:19:34,150
Nonsense, he left us out!

385
00:19:37,890 --> 00:19:40,480
It's in! 3-1!

386
00:19:40,480 --> 00:19:42,620
Only 1 minute and 30 seconds after Misugi joined the match,

387
00:19:42,620 --> 00:19:46,490
Musashi counter-attacked and scored their first goal!

388
00:19:46,490 --> 00:19:48,290
Okay, boys, we're starting!

389
00:19:49,130 --> 00:19:50,000
Okay!

390
00:19:50,000 --> 00:19:52,500
Damn it, Misugi.

391
00:19:52,500 --> 00:19:57,900
There hasn't been a situation where Misugi kept the ball alone and scored by himself up to now, right?

392
00:19:57,900 --> 00:20:01,510
Yes. In every game, they scored with Misugi's assists.

393
00:20:01,510 --> 00:20:06,880
I thought he focused on passing without straining his heart,

394
00:20:06,880 --> 00:20:09,980
but he could always use his individual abilities.

395
00:20:09,980 --> 00:20:15,980
This is great for you, Jun Misugi. However, we'll end the first half with this 3-1 score.

396
00:20:15,980 --> 00:20:21,490
Sawada, we'll leave the attack to Hyuga alone and focus on defense in the first half.

397
00:20:21,490 --> 00:20:22,990
Understood!

398
00:20:22,990 --> 00:20:24,080
Damn it, Misugi.

399
00:20:24,080 --> 00:20:25,220
I'll make you pay for this!

400
00:20:25,220 --> 00:20:27,740
This time I'll score a goal.

401
00:20:27,740 --> 00:20:30,150
The match continues with Toho's kick-off.

402
00:20:31,230 --> 00:20:33,710
Scoring a goal when you concede is my football!

403
00:20:33,710 --> 00:20:37,040
Hyuga conceded the first goal.

404
00:20:37,040 --> 00:20:38,180
When that happens...

405
00:20:38,180 --> 00:20:38,550
Come on!

406
00:20:38,550 --> 00:20:39,550
What?!

407
00:20:40,260 --> 00:20:44,050
No one can surpass me with my speed!

408
00:20:44,050 --> 00:20:44,720
Now!

409
00:20:46,330 --> 00:20:49,370
A team play that Misugi definitely intended!

410
00:20:50,020 --> 00:20:54,520
Football is not just about individual talent; team play is also important, Hyuga.

411
00:20:54,520 --> 00:20:55,770
You little...!

412
00:20:55,770 --> 00:20:58,770
Musashi moved up the field with quick passes!

413
00:20:58,770 --> 00:21:02,030
With Misugi's entry, the game fell into Musashi's rhythm!

414
00:21:02,030 --> 00:21:08,200
Toho played perfectly until now, but they conceded a goal immediately.

415
00:21:08,200 --> 00:21:10,700
This mental shock is too big for them.

416
00:21:11,110 --> 00:21:11,700
Honma!

417
00:21:12,580 --> 00:21:15,460
Sawada intercepted the pass heading for Honma!

418
00:21:15,460 --> 00:21:16,710
Okay, send it here, Takeshi!

419
00:21:18,710 --> 00:21:22,230
Misugi read Sawada's pass and intercepted it!

420
00:21:22,230 --> 00:21:24,130
Misugi threatens with a dribble here!

421
00:21:27,020 --> 00:21:28,260
No, he passed!

422
00:21:28,260 --> 00:21:30,510
He made an elegant duo pass.

423
00:21:30,510 --> 00:21:34,020
I caught you, now it's the lead role's turn!

424
00:21:35,230 --> 00:21:37,980
As if I'd concede again!

425
00:21:39,260 --> 00:21:40,560
He caught it!

426
00:21:40,560 --> 00:21:43,240
Wakashimazu with a perfect jumping catch!

427
00:21:45,530 --> 00:21:47,660
Just as expected from you, Wakashimazu.

428
00:21:47,660 --> 00:21:50,740
Speed, agility, and jumping ability.

429
00:21:50,740 --> 00:21:53,250
It seems I won't be able to score from long range.

430
00:21:54,260 --> 00:21:56,000
The first half ends here!

431
00:21:56,000 --> 00:21:59,500
When Misugi came in, the pace of the match started flowing in Musashi's favor.

432
00:21:59,500 --> 00:22:04,130
But Toho managed to fend off this counter-attack and carried a single goal.

433
00:22:04,130 --> 00:22:06,350
I won't let anyone stand in my way.

434
00:22:06,350 --> 00:22:11,350
The one who will participate in the Nationals and defeat Tsubasa will be me!

435
00:22:11,350 --> 00:22:15,380
I won't lose until I fight against Tsubasa again!

436
00:22:20,060 --> 00:22:35,060
~Anime Severler~
